  "canonicalStateVectors": {
    "_README": [
      "CanonicalStateWriter over the representative records of ReferenceSnapshots.cs.",
      "",
      "  encodedHex          the canonical bytes of 14 section 16.6, lowercase hex",
      "  hash                FNV-1a 64 of exactly those bytes",
      "  wire                the wire form: 'fnv1a:' + 16 lowercase hex characters",
      "  mode                'meta' = PlayerSnapshot alone; 'run' = player THEN run",
      "",
      "Two decisions of this encoding are NOT spelled out in the 16.6 table and are",
      "pinned here deliberately:",
      "",
      "  1. A 4-byte little-endian ELEMENT COUNT precedes a list's elements and a",
      "     dictionary's entries. Without it [[1],[2,3]] and [[1,2],[3]] collide --",
      "     rows nested-lists-ambiguity-a/-b are that fact, committed.",
      "  2. Every nullable-capable slot (any reference type, any Nullable<T>) carries",
      "     the 0x00/0x01 presence byte; the ROOT snapshot does not, being required.",
      "     Row optional-present-zero pins that a present zero outranks an absence."
    ],
